      "title": "MECHANICAL CHARACTERIZATION OF ENERGY DISSIPATION DEVICES IN RETROFIT SOLUTION OF REINFORCED CONCRETE FRAMES COUPLED WITH SOLID WOOD PANELS",
      "authors": "Tardo, Carola and Boggian, Francesco and Hatletveit, Magnus and Marino, Edoardo M. and Margani, Giuseppe and Tomasi, Roberto",
