      "id": "web_of_science_2189",
      "title": "A Study on Flexure Behavior of AS4/914 Grade Carbon Fiber Reinforced Plastic Laminates under Static and Fatigue Loads",
      "authors": "Panbarasu, K. and Ranganath, V. R. and Prakash, V, Raghu",
      "affiliations": "Council of Scientific \\& Industrial Research (CSIR) - India; CSIR - National Aerospace Laboratories (NAL); Indian Institute of Technology System (IIT System); Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) - Madras",
      "countries": [
