      "authors": "de Moraes Pereira, Marcos Cesar and Calil Junior, Carlito",
      "affiliations": "Pereira, MCD (Corresponding Author), SMM EESC USP, Dept Mat \\& Manufacture, BR-13566590 Sao Carlos, SP, Brazil. de Moraes Pereira, Marcos Cesar, SMM EESC USP, Dept Mat \\& Manufacture, BR-13566590 Sao Carlos, SP, Brazil. Calil Junior, Carlito, SET EESC USP, LaMEM Lab Madeiras \\& Estruturas Madeira, Dept Struct Engn, BR-13566590 Sao Carlos, SP, Brazil.",
