      "title": "Passive envelope solutions to aid design of sustainable livestock buildings in Mediterranean climate",
      "authors": "De Masi, Rosa Francesca and Ruggiero, Silvia and Tariello, Francesco and Vanoli, Giuseppe Peter",
      "affiliations": "Università degli Studi del Sannio, Department of Engineering, Benevento, BN, Italy; Università degli Studi del Molise, Campobasso, CB, Italy",
