      "authors": "Gerber, Adam and Tannert, Thomas",
      "affiliations": "The University of British Columbia, Department of Civil Engineering, Vancouver, BC, Canada; The University of British Columbia, Wood Science and Civil Engineering, Vancouver, BC, Canada",
      "countries": [
