      "id": "scopus_592",
      "title": "Large-Scale Enclosure Fire Experiments Adopting CLT Slabs with Different Types of Polyurethane Adhesives: Genesis and Preliminary Findings",
      "authors": "Hopkin, Danny J. and Węgrzyński, Wojciech and Spearpoint, Michael John and Fu, Ian and Krenn, Harald and Sleik, Tim and Gorska, Carmen and Stapf, Gordian",
      "affiliations": "OFR Consultants, Manchester, Greater Manchester, United Kingdom; Institut Techniki Budowlanej Warsaw, Warsaw, MA, Poland; KLH Massivholz GmbH, Teufenbach-Katsch, Austria; Binder Holz GmbH, Fugen, Austria; Stora Enso Oyj, Helsinki, Uusimaa, Finland; Henkel & Cie. AG, Sempach Station, Switzerland",
      "countries": [
