    {
      "id": "scopus_2103",
      "title": "WCTE 2014 - World Conference on Timber Engineering, Proceedings",
      "authors": "Autor não informado",
      "affiliations": "Afiliação não informada",
      "countries": "País não informado",
      "journal": "WCTE 2014 - World Conference on Timber Engineering, Proceedings",
      "year": 2014,
      "score": 30,
      "abstract": "The proceedings contain 411 papers. The topics discussed include: feasilibity of using poplar as cross layer to fabricate cross-laminated timber; estimation of bending stiffness, moment carrying capacity and internal shear force of sugi CLT panel; creep and duration of load characteristics of cross laminated timber; effect of growth ring orientation on the rolling shear properties of wooden cross layer under two-plate shear test; evaluating rolling shear strength properties of cross laminated timber by torsional shear tests and bending tests; three dimensional fibre orientation models for wood based on laser scanning utilizing the tracheid effect; safety of timber - an analysis of quality control options; the behaviour of plank (tongue and groove)wood decking systems under the effects of concentrated load; characterizing influence of laminate characteristics on elastic properties of single-layer in cross laminated timber; and bamboo reinforced glulam beams: an alternative to punched metal plate, GFRP and CFRP reinforced glulam beams.",
