      "id": "scopus_1107",
      "title": "Non-linear simulation of shaking-table tests on 3- and 7-storey X-Lam timber buildings",
      "authors": "Rinaldin, Giovanni and Fragiacomo, Massimo",
      "affiliations": "Università degli Studi di Sassari, Department of Architecture, Sassari, SS, Italy; Università degli Studi dell'Aquila, Department of Civil, L'Aquila, AQ, Italy",
      "countries": [
