      ],
      "journal": "WCTE 2018 - World Conference on Timber Engineering",
      "year": 2018,
      "score": 36,
      "abstract": "The hygrothermal behavior of cross-laminated timber (CLT) is still not well understood due to the relative novelty of the product and the relatively high variability within and between manufacturers. This paper presents the findings culminating from an experiment, in which a full scale (2.00 m × 2.13 m) Douglas Fir CLT",
