    {
      "id": "scopus_979",
      "title": "Numerical study of alternative seismic-resisting systems for CLT buildings",
      "authors": "Loss, Cristiano and Pacchioli, Stefano and Polastri, Andrea and Casagrande, Daniele and Pozza, Luca and Smith, Ian",
      "affiliations": "University of Northern British Columbia, Wood Engineering, Prince George, BC, Canada; Università di Trento, Department of Civil, Environmental and Mechanical Engineering, Trento, TN, Italy; Istituto per la Valorizzazione del Legno e delle Specie Arboree, Sesto Fiorentino, FI, Italy; Alma Mater Studiorum Università di Bologna, Chemical, Bologna, BO, Italy; University of New Brunswick, Faculty of Forestry and Environmental Management, Fredericton, NB, Canada",
