      "title": "Flexural behavior of adhesively bonded cross-laminated timber-concrete composite (TCC) panel with glass-fiber textile mesh as reinforcement in concrete: Experimental studying and numerical simulation",
      "authors": "Chen, Haoze and Ma, Wenzhuo and Kasal, Bohumil and Wei, Yang and Yan, L. B.",
      "affiliations": "Technische Universität Braunschweig, Department of Organic and Wood-Based Construction Materials, Braunschweig, Niedersachsen, Germany; Fraunhofer Institute for Wood Research, Wilhelm-Klauditz-Institut, WKI, Braunschweig, Niedersachsen, Germany; Nanjing Forestry University, College of Civil Engineering, Nanjing, Jiangsu, China",
