      "authors": "Alves, Larissa Fé and Pessôa, Poliana De Melo and Jardim, Pedro Ignacio Lima Gadelha and Faustino, Emerson and Dos Santos, Herisson Ferreira and Lahr, Francisco Antonio Rocco and de Almeida, Diego Henrique and Christóforo, André Luís",
      "affiliations": "Universidade Federal de São Carlos, Department of Civil Engineering, Sao Carlos, SP, Brazil; Instituto Federal de Educação, Ciência e Tecnologia de Rondônia – IFRO, Vilhena, RO, Brazil; Universidade de São Paulo, Department of Structural Engineering, Sao Paulo, SP, Brazil",
