        {
          "id": "scopus_158",
          "title": "CASE STUDY: SEISMIC AND GRAVITATIONAL DESIGN OF 15-STORY OFFICE AND RESIDENTIAL BUILDING ARCHETYPES WITH A SEMI-RIGID CLT DIAPHRAGM AND REINFORCED CONCRETE SHEAR WALLS IN CHILE",
          "authors": "Barrios, Sebastian and Véliz, Fernando and Berwart, Sebastián and Montaño, Jairo A. and Araya, Raúl and Lagos, Jorge and Beltrán, Martín and Chacón, Matías F. and Valdivieso, D. N. and Guindos, Pablo and Almazán, José Luis and Santa Maria, Hernan",
