        },
        {
          "id": "scopus_283",
          "title": "Shear performance of CLT wall-floor joints with inclined screws; 木質構造用ねじの斜め打ちによるCLT壁-床接合部のせん断性能",
          "authors": "Tomitaka, Ryosuke and Imai, Makoto and Toda, Masahiko",
