          "journal": "Journal of Physics: Conference Series",
          "year": 2024,
          "score": 4,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 311 papers. The topics discussed include: highly stable kinematic nonlinear simulations using a Taylor basis; flexural wave control using a far field adaptive vibration neutralizer; one-year dynamic monitoring of a steel-concrete composite overpass; immersed-boundary fluid-structure interaction of membranes and shells; efficient time-dependent reliability analysis for a railway bridge model; comparing open-source BEM solvers for analyzing wave energy converters; improved double-point material point method for dynamic geotechnical problems; further dynamic-integrity-based reliability analysis; dynamic soil-structure interaction of a continuous railway bridge; torsional aero-elastic oscillations of an elastically mounted circular cylinder; field-testing and serviceability assessment of a lively footbridge; experimental analysis of cross-laminated timber floors; structural assessment of a half-built building by vibration tests; and quadratic basis pursuit in model updating of underconstrained problems.",
