          "year": 2023,
          "score": 10,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 602 papers. The topics discussed include: comparison of the structural capacity of shear walls sheathed with oriented strand board and recycled material subjected to cyclic loading; pendulum impact hammer tests on timber beams - experimental setup; elastomechanical properties of glued laminated timber made of strength graded oil palm lumber; flexural properties of oil palm wood based glue laminated timber using finite element method; experimental characterization of the multi-directional behavior of angle brackets and hold-downs; solutions for edge connections to build two-way spanning cross laminated timber slabs; impact sound insulation performance of raised discrete floating floor assemblies on mass timber slabs; sound insulation in cross laminated timber buildings and the effect of junctions and fasteners; effect of the aspect ratio on the seismic performance of post-tensioned cross-laminated timber rocking wall systems; a new building structural system using timber-concrete-composite members; morphologic study of hybrid tall building towards an interdisciplinary design; and methodology of rehabilitation of timber structures in historic buildings.",
