        {
          "id": "scopus_963",
          "title": "Australian Acoustical Society Annual Conference, AAS 2018",
          "authors": "Autor não informado",
          "affiliations": "Afiliação não informada",
          "countries": "País não informado",
          "journal": "Australian Acoustical Society Annual Conference, AAS 2018",
          "year": 2019,
          "score": 4,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 75 papers. The topics discussed include: influence of acoustofluidic parameters on velocity streaming of sonicated medical microbubbles; coherent waves in finite, asymmetric, one dimensional periodic structures; on the acoustic effect of screens and perforated facings; acoustics at the nanoscale; the effect of porosity on the porous coated cylinder diameter; comparison of acoustic retroreflection from corner cube arrays using FDTD simulation; six decades of room acoustics - research, design and rooms, and presence; designing for speech in a circular room; and floor airborne and impact sound insulation performance of cross laminated timber vs. timber joist and concrete systems.",
