          "year": 2016,
          "score": 0,
          "abstract": "Tyréns has together with Folkhem developed the first Environmental Product Declarations, EPD, for an entire building in the International EPD system. The environmental declaration is based on the rules PCR 2014: 02 Buildings, version 1.0, where Ulf Wiklund, Tyréns, also is international PCR coordinator. The developed EPD applies to a concept house",
