        {
          "id": "scopus_1115",
          "title": "3rd International Conference on Structures and Architecture, ICSA 2016",
          "authors": "Autor não informado",
          "affiliations": "Afiliação não informada",
          "countries": "País não informado",
          "journal": "Structures and Architecture - Proceedings of the 3rd International Conference on Structures and Architecture, ICSA 2016",
          "year": 2016,
          "score": 6,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 184 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Structures and Architecture. The topics include: Innovation in architectural steel; function and design of innovative bio-based products for the building sector; experimental analysis of a new connection system for CLT structures; bio-based structural building components grown into near net shape; energy and seismic performance of timber buildings in Mediterranean region; a new dissipative connection for CLT buildings; a didactic of tectonics; constructing and construing environmental sensations; the tectonics of recycling; specialised algorithms for different project stages in a post-formed timber gridshell design; computation tools for the design of a deployable dome structure; advances in design and fabrication of free-form reciprocal structures; the art of structure; historical development of structural ice; compressive strength of ice and cellulose-ice composite; from best practices to tactical design; the power of full scale in the education of architects; constructing things for constructing other things; an inclusive aesthetic approach to full scale building; interdisciplinary synergy; blurring boundaries through interdisciplinary engagement; three-dimensional lower-bound analysis of masonry structures; reconstruction of roof decks of large roofs as a result of a synergy between technical and architectural solutions; structural laminated bamboo passive house; application of simple surface climate models for modelling mould growth on wooden façades; an oak composite thermal dynamic envelope; designing a slender footbridge based on a passive control algorithm and genetically enhanced parametric design in the exploration of architectural solutions.",
