        {
          "id": "scopus_1251",
          "title": "World Conference on Timber Engineering 2012, WCTE 2012 - Poster Papers",
          "authors": "Autor não informado",
          "affiliations": "Afiliação não informada",
          "countries": "País não informado",
          "journal": "World Conference on Timber Engineering 2012, WCTE 2012",
          "year": 2012,
          "score": 4,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 389 papers. The topics discussed include: investigation of the splitting behavior of radiate pine and LVL under tension and shear; properties of clear wood and structural timber of pinus halepensis from north-eastern Spain; review and survey of differential movement in woodframe construction; the cross-laminated timber standard in north America; glubam rainbow footbridge: design, construction, experiment and analysis; experimental and numerical behavior of crosslaminated timber floors in fire conditions; fire safe service installations in timber buildings; bending strength of glulam from selected Malaysian hardwood timber; estimating hardness of eucalyptus wood with a portable hardness tester; construction and assessment of a heritage Australian timber-framed store building; static horizontal loading test of Japanese traditional timber residence; and experimental study on material damping in timber beams.",
