        {
          "id": "scopus_1256",
          "title": "EURONOISE 2012 - 9th European Conference on Noise Control",
          "authors": "Autor não informado",
          "affiliations": "Afiliação não informada",
          "countries": "País não informado",
          "journal": "Proceedings - European Conference on Noise Control",
          "year": 2012,
          "score": 2,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 275 papers. The topics discussed include: effect of finite air cavity and steel studs on sound transmission loss of lightweight double panel system; FE modeling of a lightweight structure with different junctions; the calculation of the resonant sound reduction index for use in EN12354; comparison of proposed methods to include lightweight framed structures in EN 12354 prediction model; effect of structural changes on acoustic performance of wood frame walls; flanking transmission measurements in a cross laminated timber element building; evaluating vertical vibration of floated floors in concrete slabs caused by human walking; effective hearing protection performance; the use of annoyance inventories as a monitoring tool; effects of low frequency noise from open air music festivals on unconcerned people in the surrounding areas; and evaluation of noise producing toys and the product standard criteria.",
