          "year": 2010,
          "score": 12,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 510 papers. The topics discussed include: the load-displacement behavior of halved joints; experimental and numerical evaluation of notched timber-concrete joints mechanical behavior; comparative study of fiberglass reinforced timber joints versus bamboo reinforced timber joints; seismic vibration reduction design for timber frame building using visco-elastic damper; shake table tests of a three-story spatial timber frame with moment connections; experimental and theoretical report of the seismic behavior of a wood framed construction system; tubular timber poles for small wind turbines; timber-concrete composite systems with cross-laminated timber; mechanical in-plane joints between cross laminated timber panels; structural characteristics of beam-column connections using compressed wood dowels and plates; floor vibrations new results; in situ testing of timber floor vibration properties; and vibrational behavior of timber floors.",
