            "Uruguay"
          ],
          "journal": "MATERIALS",
          "year": 2018,
          "score": 13,
          "abstract": "The main objective of this work was to study the structural viability of using small-diameter logs of Uruguayan Loblolly/Slash pine, mainly from thinning operations, to design cross-laminated timber (CLT) panels. A visual grade named ``CTH''",
