        {
          "id": "web_of_science_1743",
          "title": "Design charts for a single spanned timber beam under bending - Part 2: Floor structures with inhomogeneous beam cross-section",
          "authors": "Moosbrugger, Thomas and Bogensperger, Thomas and Krenn, Harald",
          "affiliations": "Moosbrugger, T (Corresponding Author), Rubner EBG GmbH, Handwerkerzone 2, I-39030 Kiens, Italy. Moosbrugger, Thomas, Rubner EBG GmbH, I-39030 Kiens, Italy. Bogensperger, Thomas, Holz Bau Forsch Gmbh, A-8010 Graz, Austria. Krenn, Harald, KLH Massivholz GmbH, A-8842 Katsch A D Mur 202, Austria.",
