          "id": "scopus_1986",
          "title": "Utilization of waste polyethylene terephthalate felt in hybrid polymer composites: A sustainable approach for recycling and mechanical property enhancement",
          "authors": "Liu, Song and Jamil, Abuzar and Yu, Ruiwen and Prabhakar, M. N. and Lee, Dong-woo and Song, Jungil",
          "affiliations": "Changwon National University, Department of Smart Manufacturing Engineering, Changwon, Gyeongsangnam-do, South Korea; Changwon National University, Research Institute of Mechatronics, Changwon, Gyeongsangnam-do, South Korea",
          "countries": [
