          "journal": "WCTE 2016 - World Conference on Timber Engineering",
          "year": 2016,
          "score": 14,
          "abstract": "The proceedings contain 748 papers. The topics discussed include: external thermal insulation composite systems in solid timber construction; experimental study on lateral resistance of reinforced glued-laminated timber post and beam structures; a study on the effect of the visco-elastic damper on the full scale shaking table tast; comparative energy consumption study on tall cross laminated timber building for U.S. climates; numerical analysis of damage evolution of 3D timber-steel hybrid beams in bending; numerical analysis of damage evolution of 3D timber-steel hybrid beams in bending; modelling of heat transfer in timber exposed to fire; modelling the bond slip behaviour of FRP externally bonded to timber; external thermal insulation composite systems in solid timber construction; comparative energy consumption study on tall cross laminated timber building for U.S. climates; experimental study on lateral resistance of reinforced glued-laminated timber post and beam structures; mechanical performance of glue joints in structural hardwood elements; yield criteria assessment of angle-ply wood laminates for use in offshore wind turbine blades; relative storey displacement homogenization by continuous columns on wooden houses; and relative storey displacement homogenization by continuous columns on wooden houses.",
