          "id": "scopus_2111",
          "title": "THIN/PROBEAM : A software for fatigue design and analysis of composite rotor blades",
          "authors": "Philippidis, T. P. and Vassilopoulos, Anastasios P. and Katopis, K. G. and Voutsinas, Spyros G.",
          "affiliations": "University of Patras, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Rio, Achaia, Greece; National Technical University of Athens (NTUA), Department of Mechanical Engineering, Athens, Attica, Greece",
