          "id": "web_of_science_2212",
          "title": "Theoretical modelling and experimental characterization of composite material for ulna bone plate application",
          "authors": "Deshmukh, Rajkumar and Sanap, Sudarshan and Thakur, Dineshsingh",
          "affiliations": "Deshmukh, R (Corresponding Author), MIT ADT Univ, Mech Engn Dept, Pune 412201, Maharashtra, India. Deshmukh, Rajkumar; Sanap, Sudarshan; Thakur, Dineshsingh, MIT ADT Univ, Mech Engn Dept, Pune 412201, Maharashtra, India.",
